<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" /><base href="/" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css" /><HeadOutlet @rendermode="InteractiveServer" /></head><body><CascadingAuthenticationState><Routes @rendermode="InteractiveServer" /></CascadingAuthenticationState><div id="components-reconnect-modal" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"><div class="reconnect-card"><p class="reconnect-message reconnect-connecting">与服务器的连接已中断，正在尝试重新连接…</p><p class="reconnect-message reconnect-failed">无法恢复连接。请刷新页面后继续操作。</p><p class="reconnect-message reconnect-rejected">当前页面已失效。请刷新页面以继续操作。</p><button type="button" class="reconnect-reload" onclick="window.location.reload()">刷新页面</button></div></div><script src="app.js"></script><script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"></script></body></html>
